  <h2>about this archive</h2>

  <p>
    this site is a work in progress. entries are being moved here from the master notes one at a time, with care. cross-links between entries are live where you see them; the ember-colored underlines mark proper nouns under the <span class="kt">kahu-tok</span> writing convention. words set in <span class="kt">monospaced italic</span> are kahu-tok terms.
  </p>

  <p>
    if you find this place: welcome. <span class="kt">micasu</span>.
